  "content": [
    {
      "text": "My son, God will provide himself a lamb, Gen. 22:8. Your lamb shall be without blemish, Ex. 12:5. take you a lamb … and kill the passover, Ex. 12:21. lamb thou shalt offer in the morning, Ex. 29:39 (Num. 28:4). one ewe lamb of the first year without blemish, Lev. 14:10 (23:12). wolf also shall dwell with the lamb, Isa. 11:6 (65:25; 2 Ne. 21:6; 30:12). he shall gather the lambs with his arm, Isa. 40:11. brought as a lamb to the slaughter, Isa. 53:7 (Mosiah 14:7).",
